        "passed": true,
        "reason": "All async operations use await. Top-level await is used for the entry point (try { await main(); }). No .then()/.catch() chains or callbacks."
      },
      {
        "name": "Pagination with for-await-of",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "listBlobsFlat() result is iterated with `for await (const blob of containerClient.listBlobsFlat())`. No Array.from() or manual page accumulation."
