        "name": "ContainerClient.createIfNotExists()",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "await containerClient.createIfNotExists() is called to ensure the container exists."
      },
      {
        "name": "BlockBlobClient.upload() or uploadData() for string content",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "await blockBlobClient.upload(blobContent, Buffer.byteLength(blobContent)) correctly uploads the string with its byte length."
      },
      {
        "name": "ContainerClient.listBlobsFlat() async iteration",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "for await (const blob of containerClient.listBlobsFlat()) correctly iterates and logs blob.name."
      },
      {
        "name": "BlobClient.download() and reading the response stream",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "await blockBlobClient.download() is called, and the response is passed to streamToString() which reads readableStreamBody using for-await-of on the stream chunks."
      },
      {
        "name": "BlobClient.delete() and ContainerClient.delete()",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "await blockBlobClient.delete() followed by await containerClient.delete() — both called in correct order."
